OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to trace men who helped
OL,4,Aofficer after assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn appeal has been launched to trace
OL,7,Fmembers of the public that came to the
OL,8,Faid of an officer who was assaulted in
OL,9,Fa street in Derby.
OL,11,FPolice said a female officer tried to
OL,12,Fhelp a man who appeared to be lying
OL,13,Funconscious in Arbor Close, off Abbey
OL,14,FStreet. As she tried to help the man,
OL,15,Fthe force said he became violent and
OL,16,Fassaulted her at 14:45 BST on Thursday.
OL,18,FThe man was arrested and remains in
OL,19,Fpolice custody, while the officer was
OL,20,Ftaken to hospital and has since been
OL,21,Fdischarged.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
