OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to trace men who helped
OL,4,Aofficer after assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerbyshire Police said it wanted to
OL,7,Fspeak to a "number of men" who helped
OL,8,Fdetain the suspect until other officers
OL,9,Farrived.
